  "derivation": "C first allocates the missing Definitions id with owner document-root/1, slot definitions, key root, then fills missing child ids top-down with ownerId = the containing element id, slot = the descriptor-qualified containment property <containing $type>.<property> (bpmn:Definitions.rootElements, bpmn:Process.flowElements; H D1) and stableKey = JCS([contentSignature, duplicateOrdinal]); the two identical ID-less Review tasks get ordinals 0 and 1, Task_kept and Process_empty keep their ids, the ID-less Documentation stays ID-less. The profile complete-process recipe then sets isExecutable=false on every Process including the empty one (the neutral profiles declare no topology recipe and their Task types no incoming/outgoing). Entries address the written location (<element>/id, <element>/isExecutable; H B9) and are sorted per §10.1 plus the H G2 tie-breaks. Report header (H B4): sourceIdentity and targetIdentity are the envelope identity, inputRevision is baseRevision, outputRevision is revision.",
